#basePath	Day2

:: BeginDay
@trigger    SceneReady
@boostScore 100
@cutscene
@who    Astrid

$call InitUpdateMasks()
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(CoordinateInstrument, true)
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(PhotometerInstrument, true)
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(ColorInstrument, true)

$call StopPuzzleMode()
$call StopOpenMode()
$call MoveToView("DocumentPuzzle")
{@Astrid} Looks like I got some mail... At least the mail service is still working... $[Day2/Astrid/l2_a_1]
$call SubtitleController->SetSubtitlePosition(0.5, 0, 0, 40)
$call SetInputState(false)
$call SpawnDocumentToCamera("Day2DadIcecubePostcard")
{@Astrid} Wow... wish I could see the auroras there with you, Dad... $[Day2/Astrid/l2d_a_1]
$call SetInputState(true)

:: SpawnPuzzleDocs1
@trigger    DocumentInspectEnd
@when   documentId == "Day2DadIcecubePostcard"
@cutscene
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
$call Wait(1)
{@Astrid} Elijah! Finally, some news. $[Day2/Astrid/l2_a_2]
$call SpawnDocumentToCamera("HerculesPostcard")
$call SetInputState(true)

:: FlipHercules
@trigger    DocumentInspectFlip
@when   documentId == "HerculesPostcard"
@interrupt
@once

$call Wait(1)
{@Astrid} Oh Elijah... What are you getting yourself into? $[Day2/Astrid/l2d_a_2]

:: SpawnPuzzleDocs2
@trigger    DocumentInspectEnd
@when   documentId == "HerculesPostcard"
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
$call Wait(1)
$call SpawnDocumentToCamera("Day2Martha")
$call SetInputState(true)

:: DocumentPuzzleStart
@trigger    DocumentInspectEnd
@when   documentId == "Day2Martha"
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
$call Wait(1)
$call StartDocumentPuzzle("Day2DocumentPuzzle")
{@Astrid} Where is Elijah? Is he okay? $[Day2/Astrid/l2_a_3]
$call SetInputState(true)

:: IncorrectDocumentResponse1
@trigger    DocumentPuzzlePromptStart
@when documentId == "Day2DadIcecubePostcard"

{@Astrid} Elijah at IceCube...? No, that wouldn't make sense. $[Day2/Astrid/l2d_a_3]

:: IncorrectDocumentResponse2
@trigger    DocumentPuzzlePromptStart
@when documentId == "HerculesPostcard"

{@Astrid} So Elijah is staying with Aunt Martha...? $[Day2/Astrid/l2d_a_4]

:: CorrectDocumentResponse
@trigger    DocumentPuzzlePromptStart
@when documentId == "Day2Martha"
@cutscene
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
{@Astrid} Yeah, that's it. $[Day2/Astrid/a_confirm_1]
$call Wait(1)
$call MoveToView("Desk")
$call Wait(1)

$call MoveToView("Right")
{@Radio} Star HQ to Station Seven. IceCube is reading a high-energy neutrino emission from the area of the Hydra Constellation. $[Day2/Radio/l2_r_1]
{@Radio} Identification of nearby celestial objects is requested. Uploading area of interest... $[Day2/Radio/l2_r_1(2)]
$call StartNeutrinoNavigation()
$call SetInputState(true)

:: NeutrinoNavigationComplete
@trigger    NeutrinoNavigationComplete
@once

$call StopNeutrinoNavigation()
{@Radio} Neutrino Origin Detected
$call StartOpenMode()

:: PointsUpdated
@trigger    PointsUpdated
@when   sciencePoints > 2
@cutscene
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
$call SetRefGuideActive(false)

$call Wait(3)

$call StopOpenMode()
$call ClearMonitorSelection()
{@Dad} Hey Astrid, you there? Looks like your system is on... I hope you got my letter about Project Hercules. $[Day2/Dad/l2_d_1]

{@Astrid} I did... n- not that I can tell you that... $[Day2/Astrid/l2_a_4]

{@Dad} There's a satellite, built to withstand a CME. If we could decrypt what is stored on it... it would change everything. $[Day2/Dad/l2_d_4]
{@Dad} The satellite is encrypted. Each puzzle reveals part of the password. That's what you've been working on. $[Day2/Dad/l2_d_5]

{@Astrid} These puzzles.... reveal the password to the satellite? $[Day2/Astrid/l2_a_5]

{@Dad} Yeah, the guy who built it was... let's just say, eccentric. Your next puzzle is the constellation Hercules. See if the reference guide can point you in the right direction. $[Day2/Dad/l2_d_6]

{@Astrid} Ugh. I still don’t get it. Elijah said we might be too late. Too late for what? $[Day2/Astrid/l2_a_6]

$call SetInputState(true)
$call StartPuzzleNavigation()

:: PuzzleNavigationComplete
@trigger    PuzzleNavigationComplete
@cutscene
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
$call StopPuzzleNavigation()
$call SetRefGuideActive(false)
$call ClearMonitorSelection()

$call MonitorUI->PlayRadioDownload(2)
$call Wait(1)
$call MonitorUI->ShowCeresLogo()
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(SpectrometerInstrument, true)
{@Radio} Congratulations on being awarded clearance level 3. You are now cleared to use the spectrometer.
{@Radio} Please reference your CERES Operator Manual for further information about your equipment.  
{@Radio} Thanking you for being an important part of the CERES Distributed Network of Citizen Observatories. Together, we will map the stars for a better tomorrow.
$call Wait(0.5)
{@Radio} Tuning you to the Ice Cube CERES headquarters for further instruction...
$call MonitorUI->HideCeresLogo()
$call Wait(1)
$call StartPuzzleMode()
$call SetInputState(true)

:: HerculesPuzzleComplete
@trigger    CorrectPuzzleSubmission
@when   puzzleName == "Hercules"
@cutscene
@once

$call ClearMonitorSelection()
$call StopPuzzleMode()
$call SetInputState(false)
{@Astrid} Ugh, What am I even doing here.
$call EndDay2->BeginCutscene()
{@Astrid} Maybe there is a clue on this?
$call Wait(1)
{@Astrid} Why is project Hercules so important to you Elijah? 
{@Astrid} Maybe Dad knows more than he’s sharing on the radio… I’ll write him a letter.

:: EndDay
@trigger    CutsceneEnd
@when cutsceneId == "EndDay2"
@who    Radio

$call LoadNextDay()